{"channelId":"UCL_MY6NR-iZWTVu3tVxS_hQ","row":["Vet Konect",4450,"Vet Konect is a digital animal health company that is leveraging technology to enable access to animal care and social protection for livestock farmers and pet owners across Africa, regardless of their location, through their mobile devices.\n\nVision \nTo drive digital innovations for access to animal care and social protection in Africa.\n\nMission\nTo leverage digital technology to connect animal health professionals, veterinary clinics, and verified vendors to livestock farmers and pet owners while driving inclusion, transparency, and social protection.\n\nWith a vision to impact 5 million livestock farmers and pet owners while providing visibility for 100,000 animal health professionals by 2030, our solution can have a significant impact on the pet and livestock industries in Africa.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCL_MY6NR-iZWTVu3tVxS_hQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCL_MY6NR-iZWTVu3tVxS_hQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:38.408Z","channelId":"UCL_MY6NR-iZWTVu3tVxS_hQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"dea1a3e312360636640d55553e017b2650be0d838131d3a74ba17c87575330ca","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"c9060fad523f721b9e0055e2117bf36d1957792537d3496e6c37df2ff11d5c25"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCL_MY6NR-iZWTVu3tVxS_hQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":4450,"raw":"4.45K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCL_MY6NR-iZWTVu3tVxS_hQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:38.408Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinarian","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OtNdXANrZvI"]}],"cleanup":{"